  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Peel and cut the sweet potato into small chunks. Cut the carrot into small chunks. Place on a lined oven tray, drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat, then roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60e515df6f1d9121861b3d60/step-3741ce93.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the veggies are roasting, finely chop the brown onion and the garlic. Zest the lemon to get a generous pinch, then slice into wedges. Rinse the red lentils.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60e515df6f1d9121861b3d60/step-a4721bb7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large pot or saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat. Cook the onion, stirring, until softened, 3-4 minutes. Add the garlic, mild North Indian spice blend and Mumbai spice blend and stir until fragrant, 1 minute. Add the red lentils, the water, coconut milk and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using). Add the vegetable stock powder and stir to combine.\n• Bring to a simmer, then cover the pan with a lid and cook, stirring occasionally, until the lentils are soft, 20-22 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60e515df6f1d9121861b3d60/step-19577975.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While still on the oven tray, roughly mash the roasted veggies. Add the mashed veggies and baby spinach leaves to the soup, stirring, until well combined and the spinach is wilted. Add the lemon zest and a generous squeeze of lemon juice. Season.\n• TIP: Taste and add more lemon juice, if you prefer.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60e515df6f1d9121861b3d60/step-4eb77517.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Brush a mini flourtortilla on both sides with olive oil. Heat a medium frying pan over a medium-high heat and cook the tortilla until golden, 1 minute each side. Transfer to a plate and repeat with the remaining tortillas (see ingredients).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60e515df6f1d9121861b3d60/step-7301d594.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice the tortilla flatbreads in half. Divide the creamy red lentil, sweet potato and coconut soup between bowls. Top with the Greek-style yoghurt. Serve with the tortilla flatbreads and any remaining lemon wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60e515df6f1d9121861b3d60/step-449d0562.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
